invalid type: string "Enter the tactic details.\n\nTypes of tactics:\n\nVariable\n\nLump Sum\n\n\n\n8. Adding Products\n\nTo add products to a promotion:\n\nNavigate to the Investment Detail Page.\n\nClick the “Manage Products” section.\n\nAdd the required products.\n\n\n\n9. Copy Promotion\n\nTo copy a promotion:\n\nGo to the Customer Investments tab.\n\nSelect the promotion you want to copy.